Um, oops.  My apologies, in between looking at the code, driving home, and
writing up the table, I forgot the relevant line of code wasn't just a
constant, but a random number from 1/2 cost to cost-1.  The amended table
follows.  Thanks, Dave, and sorry for any confusion...

Note also that if your marker has less than the minimum, it won't let
you write the scroll.  If your marker doesn't have enough charges to finish
the task, you lose the scroll.

